{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2830, "text": "John Jones."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5330, "text": "Dr. Klein."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 7209, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6490, "text": "H .H."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 10470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7210, "text": "Klein. Hospitals, give me the creeps.\nOh, come on. Think of a hospital as a"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 13910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10470, "text": "place where people work tirelessly and\nselflessly to perform miracles."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 16430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15430, "text": "Damn,"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 22370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21130, "text": "I was this close."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 28290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25670, "text": "How long is Dan going to be here? About\ntwo weeks."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 30700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28840, "text": "You mean he's going to have to spend his\nbirthday alone?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 32220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30980, "text": "Oh, Dan won't be alone."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 39260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32479, "text": "He'll be surrounded by... people on the\ngo."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 41440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40440, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 48300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47300, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 51120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49440, "text": "Oh, my God, we're too late."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 58710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57710, "text": "we were right on time."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 61670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59670, "text": "I want to thank you for your assistance\nin the OR."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 63590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61930, "text": "Your performance was magnificent, nurse."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 65550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64129, "text": "By the way, you can get dressed now."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 69650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66930, "text": "This hospital is woefully understaffed."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 74070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70610, "text": "Billy, I want you back in that bed and I\nwant you to stay there."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 75510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74330, "text": "Do you understand what that means?"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 78270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76710, "text": "I won't be assisting with rounds."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 81010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79790, "text": "Give me the reflex hammer."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 83470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82470, "text": "And the stethoscope."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 86090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85050, "text": "And the reflector."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 87690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86690, "text": "Mine."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 89520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88359, "text": "You've got to be kidding."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 91400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90100, "text": "Unfortunately, he's not."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 94240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93240, "text": "Who are you people?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 95960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94960, "text": "We're his friends."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 97280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96240, "text": "My condolences."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 100920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98940, "text": "Mr. Fielding, I want you in that bed."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 106500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 105500, "text": "Alone."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 110460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109460, "text": "You're the best."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 114920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111840, "text": "Silly. I'm quite all right. I don't need\nthis ridiculous operation."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 118220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115680, "text": "What are you going to say when your\nulcer perforates and you start"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 125500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123280, "text": "Does he always behave like a complete\nass?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 126740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125740, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 129139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128139, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 135480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 129919, "text": "Can you cover for me a neuro?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 138100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136880, "text": "Your surgery's at seven."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 139820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 138820, "text": "God, I can't wait."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 144080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143080, "text": "Okay, come on."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 146100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145100, "text": "Where are my birthday presents?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 150440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149440, "text": "Bulls."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 151920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 150800, "text": "You shouldn't have."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 154400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152280, "text": "I figured you'd have some spare time on\nyour hands."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 158460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154840, "text": "Death be not proud."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 162500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160200, "text": "Dan, you're going to be just fine."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 166340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162720, "text": "I can feel it. Well, thank you. Of\ncourse you can feel it. I mean, it's a"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 169700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166340, "text": "-established procedure. A lot of guys\nhave little alter operations."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 172960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 170420, "text": "Dan, we know just how much guts this is\ntaking."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 174880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173480, "text": "About two feet, from what I understand."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 177020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176000, "text": "Come on, what do you say, huh?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 178980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177700, "text": "A little seven -card stud."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 182080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179480, "text": "Jack's a wild, low card, pick your hole,\nhuh?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 184820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183600, "text": "Oh, come on, you in or what?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 187320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185540, "text": "Dan, you can't behave like this."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 191420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188120, "text": "You're in a hospital. You have to follow\nyour doctor's orders and you have to"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 192420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191420, "text": "get complete rest."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 193620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192620, "text": "I'm in."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 198220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195480, "text": "Now, the staff of this hospital has a\nfirst -class reputation."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 200500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198780, "text": "I mean, what's the worst thing that\ncould happen?"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 202850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200890, "text": "I'm here to take D. Fielding to the\nmorgue."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 207810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205390, "text": "Okay, what's the second worst thing that\ncould happen?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 209610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208290, "text": "Mr. Fielding is alive."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 212070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210230, "text": "Look here, buddy. I'm breathing over\nhere."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 215490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213970, "text": "This poses a problem."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 217750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216050, "text": "Obviously, there's been some kind of\nmistake."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 220130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217990, "text": "Ain't no mistake. I got the paperwork\nright here."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 221710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220350, "text": "Sorry, Dan. I tried my best."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 225210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223390, "text": "He's here for a simple operation."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 227990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 226730, "text": "I'll check back later."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 231340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228950, "text": "Over my dead body. It's a date."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 235300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232960, "text": "Make sure you give my regards to the\nlovely Mrs. Dracula."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 240100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238860, "text": "Think you know something I don't?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 243780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240400, "text": "Oh, Dan, don't be ridiculous. What are\nthe odds of something going wrong, huh?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 246640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243860, "text": "Probably the same odds as stepping off\nthe curb, getting hit by a bus."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 256920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254420, "text": "So, what do you plan to do with this\nwatch?"}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 308000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305820, "text": "Sir, oh, sir, sir."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 311280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308400, "text": "I took this around to everybody on the\nfloor."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 316120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311480, "text": "You want to sign it? What is it? A card\nwishing Dan a prompt and painless"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 318240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316120, "text": "recovery. But there are no signatures."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 323100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318680, "text": "Like I said, a card wishing Dan a prompt\nand painless recovery."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 328320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325860, "text": "Here are those files you requested, Your\nHonor. Thanks."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 330800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329800, "text": "Alphabetized."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 336900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334440, "text": "With little red tags marking points of\ninterest."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 339920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338620, "text": "Gee, neat."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 343420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341980, "text": "May I say something else?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 347860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344280, "text": "Though I'm just subbing here at the\nassistant DA, it's been a pleasure"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 348699, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347860, "text": "with you."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 351540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348700, "text": "Yeah, well... It's been a pleasure\nworking with all of you."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 353060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352060, "text": "Mac."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 355480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354480, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 366800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365800, "text": "Of course, Roz."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 372760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 371640, "text": "That's all I have to say."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 377840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376800, "text": "Real nice guy."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 379120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378120, "text": "Yep. Very polite."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 381160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379360, "text": "Yep. Kind of makes me want to barf."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 382520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381520, "text": "Yep."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 383760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 382760, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 386000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384320, "text": "Dansky versus Rosenstein?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 389440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386500, "text": "Oh, isn't that the pooper scooper case?\nUh -huh."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 391220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389660, "text": "Mac, have you seen the evidence?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 392520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 391460, "text": "Hey, I tagged it."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 398460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394760, "text": "Stay that one till after lunch. I'm with\nyou, sir. What else? People versus"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 400060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398460, "text": "green. Here's the file."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 412300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407040, "text": "Well, not wishing to prejudge any case,\nwhat is the specific charge against"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 414140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412300, "text": "Sister Ralph?"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 420060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415980, "text": "He was apprehended in front of St.\nPaddy's attempting to solicit funds for"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 422080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420060, "text": "home for wayward brunettes."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 425500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424300, "text": "Defense pleads guilty, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 430160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426040, "text": "And the state appreciates that plea from\nthe lovely and able public defender."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 431540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430540, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 433400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431580, "text": "You're very, very welcome."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 442440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438440, "text": "Let's make that a $50 fine, and Ralph,\ndon't let this kind of thing become a"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 443440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442440, "text": "habit."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 445440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444440, "text": "Ross."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 447880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446840, "text": "Let's move it, sister."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 450040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449040, "text": "Hey!"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 452380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450360, "text": "Respect the uniform, if not the man."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 456200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454600, "text": "I hated you in Norma Rae."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 461200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460200, "text": "Hi, everybody."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 465680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462880, "text": "Dan Fielding, what the hell are you\ndoing here? You're supposed to be in the"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 469440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465680, "text": "hospital. Hey, why hang around that\ndump, huh? I'm fine."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 476180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475180, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 477340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476220, "text": "Come on. No,"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 482080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478060, "text": "I'm okay. I'm okay, okay. I just tripped\nover a gum wrapper."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 489150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485190, "text": "Walker? They didn't want him to leave\nthe hospital so early. They insisted he"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 489849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489150, "text": "use this."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 490729, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489850, "text": "Give it to me."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 492110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490730, "text": "Let me get to my desk."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 504090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 502790, "text": "Take your time, Dan."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 510610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505310, "text": "And... Watch out for the..."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 515539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514539, "text": "Thank you, sir."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 529520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522700, "text": "Looks like you're in a little discomfort"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 530520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529520, "text": "there, buddy."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 532800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531800, "text": "Buddy?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 535360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534300, "text": "Did you say buddy?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 540640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535880, "text": "Who the hell are you? I am Albert\nRogers, the assistant DA temporarily"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 541419, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540640, "text": "to this courtroom."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 542420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541420, "text": "Get out."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 546390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542640, "text": "No, you see... I was... No, you see, I\nam the district attorney around here."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 548450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546610, "text": "But I was told... I don't care what you\nwere told."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 549910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548750, "text": "Yeah, but you see, I was... Hill!"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 551170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550170, "text": "Scalpel!"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 558610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 555950, "text": "Sir, if you're absolutely sure, you\nwon't be needing me."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 560530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559190, "text": "Dan, you think you can work?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 562370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560750, "text": "Sir, I assure you, I can do this."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 565450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563330, "text": "Well, I guess we won't be needing you,\nMr. Rogers."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 568030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565890, "text": "That's right. Go back to your\nneighborhood, Mr. Rogers."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 569810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568410, "text": "You think you can do that?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 575610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572650, "text": "Paul, if we need you to come back. It\nwould be a great pleasure."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 579290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577410, "text": "I knew he was going to say that."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 582970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580750, "text": "May I say you're looking lovely this\nevening?"}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 586250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583790, "text": "I can break cinder blocks with my\nforehead."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 589150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587750, "text": "May I say goodbye?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 594890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592710, "text": "All right, let's get back to work, Matt."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 596110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595110, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 600150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596730, "text": "Dan, what can you possibly do in this\ncondition?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 601709, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600770, "text": "Try me."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 602710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601710, "text": "You might be surprised."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 605550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603990, "text": "We're already here, people."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 611630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 610630, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 612970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 611970, "text": "Coming, sir."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 624430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623430, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 630190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627570, "text": "Might I suggest a medicated shampoo?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 635499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634700, "text": "What's the matter?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 636740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635500, "text": "I think I'm gonna sneeze."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 638040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637040, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 639320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638260, "text": "Stitches, woman, stitches."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 642080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 640740, "text": "What happens to be sneezes?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 644200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642740, "text": "You ever see the movie Alien?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 649880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648880, "text": "You got it."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 653260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 651320, "text": "Dan, are you sure we shouldn't just call\nMr."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 655140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653500, "text": "Rogers back? Sir, I'm fine."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 658460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655540, "text": "I am completely capable of performing my\nduties."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 671810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670730, "text": "Let's give it a shot, Matt."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 673390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672050, "text": "People versus Barbarella."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 678890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677890, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 682010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680210, "text": "Phil! My pills!"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 688690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685210, "text": "Whatever you do, don't look directly at\nher."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 695150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693690, "text": "What's the charge here, Mr."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 697490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695370, "text": "Prosecutor? Oh, I need my file, sir."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 699910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698430, "text": "I'll put it on your table."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 709050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705710, "text": "If you can't discharge the duties of\nyour job, then you really have no place"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 710029, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709050, "text": "here in the courtroom."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 711210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710030, "text": "All right. All right. I'll get it."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 793700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792240, "text": "Ever have one of those days?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 800760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798860, "text": "Come on, guys. Let's go cheer up Dan."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 807600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806260, "text": "Hey, how you doing, pal?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 810520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808360, "text": "If I had a gun, I would shoot you."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 812660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811600, "text": "Almost back to normal."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 815920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814560, "text": "Would you look at him?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 817580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816580, "text": "Do I have to?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 820060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819060, "text": "Gee, Dan."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 822710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820490, "text": "How do you eat with that thing sticking\nup your nose?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 824490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 823290, "text": "This is how I eat."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 827690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825430, "text": "I'm getting kind of full. Somebody want\nto finish my carrots?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 829590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828590, "text": "Oh, no thanks."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 832030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829950, "text": "We sucked up dinner before we came."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 834870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833350, "text": "So I hear you're going to be just fine."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 836210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 835210, "text": "That's what they tell me."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 837590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836410, "text": "No reason for them to lie."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 839950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837990, "text": "Unless you're desperately and hopelessly\nill."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 842530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 841530, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 848590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843210, "text": "Oh, took a turn for the worse, did we?\nYou, get the hell out."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 852160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 849000, "text": "Hey, didn't anybody tell you it's not\npolite to talk with your nose full?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 858980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854280, "text": "Dan, what is going on with you? Listen,\nif you don't mind... Well, Dan, we do"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 862540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858980, "text": "mind. Why did you come back to work\nearly? Why are you risking your health?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 864060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862800, "text": "Because he's nuts."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 870640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867800, "text": "How are you feeling, Mr. Fielding? I am\nin great pain."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 872140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871140, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 874720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873620, "text": "Oral? Yes."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 876360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875360, "text": "Disappointed?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 882040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880460, "text": "Now, you have a very stupid friend here."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 883360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882360, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 885060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884060, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 887480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885380, "text": "Doesn't seem to understand he's a very\nsick man."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 892340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888580, "text": "You know, Fielding, it's my obligation\nto do everything I can to ensure your"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 894680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892340, "text": "recovery. That's part of my Hippocratic\noath."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 900980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896180, "text": "That's the canon of dignity and mercy we\ndoctors hold sacred."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 904360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 902980, "text": "Will you be my friend?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 907940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906880, "text": "Now, where was I?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 909720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908720, "text": "Dignity and mercy?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 911599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910960, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 914840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911600, "text": "I want to talk to the duty nurse about\nyour enema. I'm not going to pay for any"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 915840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914840, "text": "enema."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 917820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916820, "text": "My treat."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 922260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920560, "text": "Well, we'll be going."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 923760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922760, "text": "What, so soon?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 926540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923800, "text": "You don't want to stick around for\ndessert? We're going to be inhaling some"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 927540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926540, "text": "baked Alaska."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 931980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928960, "text": "Dan, you're not going to listen to the\ndoctor. You're going to listen to me. If"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 933680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931980, "text": "you don't slow down, you're going to\ndie."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 936080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934180, "text": "Now, what do I have to do to keep you in\nbed?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 941170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940170, "text": "We gotta be going now."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 943290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942090, "text": "Well, Dan, you know what they say."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 944770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 943530, "text": "As long as you got your health."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 948510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947510, "text": "Or insurance."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 951050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949490, "text": "Bye. Bye, Dan."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 953330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951730, "text": "I'll catch up with you guys downstairs."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 957630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954750, "text": "Change your mind about dessert, Harry?\nI'll call up for an extra tube."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 961350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959290, "text": "Dan, can I say something to you in\nconfidence?"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 963190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961610, "text": "Of course, sir. You're a jerk."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 965450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964090, "text": "Your secret is safe with me."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 970340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967400, "text": "Something is making you act this way.\nWhat is it? What was that thing about"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 973560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970340, "text": "getting back to work so quick? Are you\nafraid your job's going to be taken away"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 977480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973560, "text": "from you? Hey, listen. You want to watch\na little TV with me? Dan, I want to"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 978480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977480, "text": "talk to you."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 981540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978720, "text": "Petty co -junction. Highly underrated as\nfar as I'm concerned."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 983220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982220, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 986760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984160, "text": "Now, something is making you act\nrecklessly."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 988539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987540, "text": "What is it?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 992420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988540, "text": "Have you got some kind of repressed\nemotional conflict that you're afraid to"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 993420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992420, "text": "look at?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 994620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993620, "text": "Listen to yourself."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 996100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994720, "text": "Who the hell do you think you are?"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 998519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 997580, "text": "analyzing everybody."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1001080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998520, "text": "Dan. Do you remember that dream I told\nyou about me being chased by the giant"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1004440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001080, "text": "cucumbers through the Grand Canyon? You\nthought that had sexual overtones."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1011020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007060, "text": "Dan, I am real concerned about you as a\nfriend."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1013260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012260, "text": "Friend?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1020640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017520, "text": "Dan, I want to talk to you. I don't want\nto talk to you."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1022340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021200, "text": "I am not going to listen."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1026510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022700, "text": "Has it ever occurred to you? to you that\nthe only reason I ever listen to you is"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1028790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026510, "text": "because it is my job. I have to."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1034390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032369, "text": "I'm afraid visiting hours are over."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1038970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037970, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1043430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042130, "text": "Happy birthday, Dan."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1053650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051310, "text": "I'll be back in a half an hour. What\nfor?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1056630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054930, "text": "Your sponge bath."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1062550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058950, "text": "I have an itsy bitsy sponge."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1064090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063090, "text": "Ha!"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1067550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066550, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1075330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073890, "text": "Are you lonely?"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1084010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082030, "text": "Next time, it won't be empty."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1089730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088730, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1091890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090890, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1095290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1094290, "text": "Sheila."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1098930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1095830, "text": "Dan, I came as soon as I heard."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1102590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101150, "text": "Where did you get the uniform?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1106910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104610, "text": "I used to be a candy striper."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1110770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108230, "text": "I get off on..."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1116620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114600, "text": "Mercy. So, what brings you by?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1119020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118020, "text": "Gifts."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1121380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120360, "text": "Little kibitzing."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1127500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123140, "text": "You know, it's very strange. I wonder\nwhy is it that the only time you show up"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1129920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127500, "text": "in my life is when I'm ill or\nincapacitated."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1132020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131020, "text": "Luck."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1134720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133480, "text": "Dan, I want you."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1138310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135590, "text": "I want you like never before."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1142150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138730, "text": "Chill, chill. This is a hospital. I've\ngot wires attached to my body monitoring"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1144910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142150, "text": "my vital signs. I've got a tube running\nup my nose."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1148070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145610, "text": "I sense reluctance."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1152410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149690, "text": "Reluctance? Don't you understand the\nmeaning of the word restraint?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1155410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153330, "text": "A device that restricts movement."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1159570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157070, "text": "Oh, this is wonderful."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1164050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162670, "text": "Is this available in King?"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1167570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165030, "text": "Sheila, I can barely move."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1169490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168230, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1172490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171490, "text": "I'll drive."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1177210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175750, "text": "I want you."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1179490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177830, "text": "I want you now."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1184030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179790, "text": "Sheila, listen, this is my life. We're\ntalking about my life. Are you so driven"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1187230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184030, "text": "by pathological need that you would put\nit at risk just to satisfy your tawdry"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1188230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187230, "text": "kick?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1189550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1188490, "text": "Should I stop?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1191230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190230, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1196330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194370, "text": "No. Where was I?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1200430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196850, "text": "Dan, I want you. I want you now."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1202530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201490, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1204330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203050, "text": "Don't mention it."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1206410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205230, "text": "Come here, Dan."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1209750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208750, "text": "Coming."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1215870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211630, "text": "Now, open your mouth and say..."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1225010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224010, "text": "Hello, Station 9."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1228690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227230, "text": "What's going on in your room?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1234110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230210, "text": "Mr. Feldman, you were just having a\ndream."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1236570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234790, "text": "Now go back to sleep."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1241950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238810, "text": "No, I will not be your friend."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1272870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269930, "text": "treated me like scum. Why in the world\nwould I want to see him again?"}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1274590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273470, "text": "To watch him suffer?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1277570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276570, "text": "Good enough for me."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1281270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278710, "text": "It's Dan's birthday, so everybody put on\nyour hats."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1286090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283610, "text": "Why are we doing this?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1293590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290230, "text": "Dan is sick and we have to cheer him up.\nDoes that mean we have to humiliate"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1294590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293590, "text": "ourselves?"}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1296530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295250, "text": "Yeah, I'm pretty sure it does."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1303600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302600, "text": "That's going to be a problem."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1321760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1315960, "text": "Sorry I'm late."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1325960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322980, "text": "There was a puddle on the corner and I\ngot suctioned to the pavement for a"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1326960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325960, "text": "while."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1329640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1327940, "text": "Well, why are you wearing that costume?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1331200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330200, "text": "Because it's Saturday."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1335100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333000, "text": "It's always nice to flip out of the\nuniform on weekends."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1337860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1336120, "text": "Getting something a little more\ncomfortable."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1341700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339080, "text": "I entertain kids at the orphanage on\nSaturdays."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1344100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1341920, "text": "Children just love this get -up."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1350060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349020, "text": "A little advice."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1354540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351460, "text": "Change your shoes before you get stuck\nin front of a bus."}
